          {
            "date": "Jul 3, 2025",
            "id": "a5b4af31-2710-4fd6-9058-ff98e21676ba",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Joseph, thank you for sharing your experience! We appreciate your feedback regarding the cleaning supplies and will use it to improve future stays. We hope to welcome you back to RealJoy Vacations soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Absolutely fantastic stay. Couldn’t recommend higher. Beautiful home, stunning neighbourhood and pool, and extremely responsive hosts.Note: the lack of cleaning supplies is a bit of a joke, and I’ve seen complaints against the management company elsewhere online so they’re clearly aware. When renting a home for a vacation, you shouldn’t have to worry about trash bags and TP in my opinion! But aside from that, I have no complaints",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Heather R.",
        "date": "2025-06-20T20:45:06Z",
        "id": "6855d6a01c206e784b4b53fa",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Jul 24, 2025",
            "id": "5d441d16-9c35-43e2-9fb3-2a6b9a5442ca",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Heather, thank you for your 5-star review. We appreciate your feedback and hope to host you again soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This is a gorgeous and well kept home with a true coastal cottage feel. Kitchen was well appointed with all necessary items for cooking. Ice maker struggled just a bit to keep up, but that was really the only issue. Bedrooms are so adorably decorated and the deep soaking tub was amazing. Garage is on the smaller side. Fit a Ford Escape fine, but not our 4 Runner. Community pool is fantastic and had lots of room to swim! You will use the Inlet Beach Public Access just over a mile from the neighborhood. There are bikes and it is possible to bike to the beach. We truly enjoyed our stay!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Beautiful home and neighborhood",
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
